[l_braz_por]
steal_blueprints_infiltrate_naval_design_office=Infiltrar escritório de design naval
steal_blueprints_infiltrate_naval_design_office_desc=Nosso agente entrará em um fornecedor menor na construção naval como empregado e usar sua posição para fazer cópias dos planos disponíveis.
steal_blueprints_infiltrate_naval_design_office_outcome=Nosso agente infiltrou o fornecedor de equipamento naval com sucesso e fez cópias de vários projetos de componentes chave.

[l_english]
steal_blueprints_infiltrate_naval_design_office=Infiltrate Naval Design Office
steal_blueprints_infiltrate_naval_design_office_desc=Our Agent will enter a smaller supplier in naval construction as a minor employee and use this position to make copies of available plans.
steal_blueprints_infiltrate_naval_design_office_outcome=Our agent successfully infiltrated a naval equipment supplier and made copies of a number of key component blueprints.

[l_french]
steal_blueprints_infiltrate_naval_design_office=Infiltration d'un bureau d'étude naval
steal_blueprints_infiltrate_naval_design_office_desc=Notre agent va se faire comme employé chez un petit fournisseur de la construction navale et en profiter pour faire des copies des plans disponibles.
steal_blueprints_infiltrate_naval_design_office_outcome=Notre agent a infiltré avec succès un fournisseur d'équipements maritimes et fait des copies d'un nombre conséquent d'études d'une importance vitale.

[l_german]
steal_blueprints_infiltrate_naval_design_office=Marinekonstruktionsbüro infiltrieren
